    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/kosone-hostel/hotel/bali-id.html",
    "name": "Kos One Hostel",
    "detail": "This is the best hostel + hotel I have ever stayed at. Every morning there’s a free 1-hour yoga class, and the yoga instructor is highly skilled. The breakfast is of very high quality, comparable to a brunch restaurant. The beds in the 4-person dorm are very spacious, with plenty of room, excellent air conditioning, and the shower area is stocked with Bali brand sensia toiletries. It’s cleaned frequently every day, so it's very clean. The pool is perfect, and every day I sunbathe by the pool. Volunteers organize various activities every day, and during my 5-day stay, I made many friends and had a great time! The free 15-minute massage can be a bit pushy in terms of sales. In short, I will definitely come back. This is the best hotel I have stayed in Bali.",
