  {
    "hotel_id": "3121957",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/fox-harris-hotel-jimbaran-beach/hotel/bali-id.html",
    "name": "FOX Hotel Jimbaran Beach Bali",
    "detail": "I am very satisfied with the hotel. The bed is clean and big, and the air conditioning, Wi-Fi, and smart TV were great. The bathroom has a structure that leaks water onto the floor, so you have to be careful when getting out of the bathtub. Still, it is clean, and the room cleaning is done thoroughly every day, which I appreciate. The towels are also clean. The swimming pool is clean, and there are towels available at the bar next to the pool, so you can use them when swimming. Since the sun is strong, it's essential to apply sunscreen. I also brought burn ointment, which was useful. I ordered food through Grab and picked it up at the lobby drop. The food I had at the bar was average. I think delivery would be better. The fifth photo is of breakfast, which was delicious and satisfying. It was a variety of rice, fried rice, bread, salad, fruit, sausage, coffee, and drinks (juice, smoothies). They made either noodles or fried rice for vegetarians, so those who don't eat meat could also have a meal. It seems like a great hotel to stay in Bali. The pool usage hours are also long, which is nice. Above all, the staff members were friendly, making my stay pleasant and comfortable.",
